# No environment variables are required to build or run this site.
#
# The quote form uses Netlify Forms, which needs no API key: Netlify finds the
# form by parsing the deployed HTML and collects submissions itself. See the
# README section "Quote form".
#
# This file is kept as the place to put any future VITE_-prefixed variable.
# Vite inlines those at build time, so anything added here must also be set in
# Netlify BEFORE a build runs, not after.
